  "label": "Hillary Clinton is mapped as the subject of abusive accusations",
  "description": "The visual entity 'Hillary_Clinton' is mapped onto the textual accusation in 'text_chunk_1' and subsequent text, which falsely attributes to her the moral reprehensibility of finding humor in violent acts. The meme uses her image as the visual anchor for the abusive text, creating an analogical mapping where the person in the image is the target of the accusation. This mapping is explicit through spatial juxtaposition: her portrait is overlaid with text that directly accuses her, implying she is the 'she' in the text.",
